      "body": {
        "answer": "合成演示，未调用聊天模型。折线来自演示库实际查询；本例统计每月有效订单数。图表不补造缺失观测，完整 SQL 和数据见查询证据。",
        "success": true,
        "trace_id": "113e70ec-e4c6-4311-878b-b7aa2895f3b2",
        "session_id": "delivery-demo-7dcef8a4a90b466d90b6e1c499f00a24",
        "mode": "react",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "tool": "run_sql",
            "arguments": {
              "sql": "SELECT substr(o.order_time,1,7) AS month, COUNT(*) AS order_count FROM business.orders o JOIN business.users u ON u.user_id=o.user_id WHERE u.is_test=0 AND o.status IN ('paid','completed') GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"
